  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Cut cod fillets into 1-inch pieces.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together gochugaru, soy sauce, brown sugar, and rice vinegar.",
    "Thread 4-5 pieces of cod onto each skewer, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush the top of each skewer with the chili flake mixture and sprinkle with green onions.",
    "Brush grill grates with vegetable oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill skewers for 4-5 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Serve immediately."
